To ensure MED values are properly compared for route selection within your sub-AS groups, use these commands:

```
configure router bgp
  best-path-selection
    always-compare-med zero
  exit
exit
```

This configuration forces BGP to compare MED values for all paths, regardless of neighbor AS differences. The `zero` parameter treats routes without MED attributes as having a value of 0, maintaining consistent path selection behavior.
