To configure the Huawei NE40E to ignore the AS path length during BGP best path selection, use the following commands:

```
configure router bgp
    best-path-selection
        as-path-ignore ipv4 ipv6
    exit
exit
```

This configuration disables AS path length comparison for both IPv4 and IPv6 unicast routes. If you need to apply this to additional address families (e.g., VPNv4, multicast), include the relevant parameters in the `as-path-ignore` command (e.g., `as-path-ignore ipv4 ipv6 vpn-ipv4 mvpn-ipv4`).
------------
