Based on your request, here are the CLI commands to configure the SSL policy for your BGP group:

```
configure router
   bgp
      group external_peers
         type external
         auth-keychain secure_bgp123
      exit
   exit
exit
```

**Important considerations:**
1. The `type external` command designates the peer group for external partners
2. The `auth-keychain secure_bgp123` command applies the keychain-based authentication policy to all peers in the group
