## User question:
Hey, on Huawei NE40E boxes, how do I view the list of path segment labels associated with BGP topology info for a specific SR policy? The policy is tagged with IDENTIFIER1 and originates from a remote node in AS200 with topology identifier 192.168.1.1, BGP router ID 192.168.1.2, and IPv4 identifier 192.168.2.1. I’m trying to verify if the path segments are correctly advertised from that neighbor.
