- `link-state-import-enable` enables BGP to import and advertise IGP topology details (network paths/device connections) via the BGP-LS address family.  
- Define a BGP peer group (`group <group-name>`) and specify the external system's IP address (`neighbor <peer-ip>`).  

**Follow-up actions needed:**  
1. Replace `<group-name>` with your BGP peer group name (e.g., `LS-MAPPING`).  
2. Replace `<peer-ip>` with the IP address of the external mapping system.  
