## Proposed answer:
To prioritize comparing the source router's identifier (router ID) before cluster-related information in the BGP decision process for your VPNv4 setup, use the following CLI configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp
    best-path-selection
        no ignore-router-id
    exit
exit
```

This configuration ensures the router ID comparison is included in the best-path selection process, giving it priority over cluster-related attributes.
