To configure the Huawei NE40E to set a minimum route advertisement interval of 20 seconds for the BGP group "core_peers," use the following commands:

```
router bgp <your_AS_number>
 group core_peers
  min-route-advertisement 20
```

Replace `<your_AS_number>` with your router's BGP autonomous system number. This ensures updates to the group "core_peers" are not sent more frequently than every 20 seconds, preventing flooding while maintaining path calculation freshness.
