{'Parameters': 'percentage', 'Info': 'Start to generate warning messages if it reaches maximum percentage value.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 100 case-sensitive characters.'}
{'Parameters': 'alert-only', 'Info': 'Allows the router to generate log message without terminating session when the maximum is exceeded.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'idle-forever', 'Info': 'Indicates that, when the threshold for the maximum number of routes is exceeded, the device does not automatically re-set up connections until the reset bgp command is run.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'idle-timeout times', 'Info': 'Value of idle-timeout timer(minutes).\nThe value is an integer ranging from 1 to 1200, in minutes.'}
