This configuration modifies the BGP best path selection process to:
- Ignore AS path length for VPNv4 routes (`as-path-ignore vpn-ipv4`)
- Disregard next-hop IGP metrics (`ignore-nh-metric`)

These changes prevent route prioritization based on AS path length or next-hop distance, ensuring more specific routes are no longer overridden by aggregated paths.
