- The `export` command directly applies your pre-configured route policy "outbound-filter" to the neighbor's outbound IPv4 routes.  
- Replace `outbound-filter` with your exact policy name if it contains spaces/special characters (enclose in double quotes: `export "Policy Name"`).  
