The bestroute nexthop-resolved aigp command allows VPN routes to participate in route selection using the AIGP attribute of the BGP LSP through which they are transmitted.
The undo bestroute nexthop-resolved aigp command deletes the configuration.
By default, VPN routes are not allowed to participate in route selection using the AIGP attribute of the BGP LSP through which they are transmitted.
