            "Parameters": "min-holdtime 80",
            "Info": "Enforces the minimum acceptable hold time (in seconds) negotiated with the peer, preventing sessions from establishing if the peer proposes a lower value. Default: 0 (no enforcement). Value range: 0 or 20–65535."
