## User question:
Hey, on our Huawei NE40E boxes handling dual-stack VPNs, I’m trying to tweak BGP path selection so it combines the external distance metrics (scaled up by 500) with internal routing protocol hops (multiplied by 200) to pick routes. Any idea how to set up the VPNv6 AF to mix both factors in the decision process? Our setup needs this to balance traffic between two providers and internal links.
