To resolve the BGP best-path selection issue with router IDs across VPN instances, use the following configuration:

```huawei
configure
service
    vprn <your_service_id>
        bgp
            best-path-selection
                ignore-router-id
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

**Key notes:**  
1. Replace `<your_service_id>` with your actual VPRN service ID.  
2. This command disables router ID comparisons during best-path selection, allowing other metrics to take precedence.  
3. Apply this configuration to each VPN instance where router ID checks interfere with path preference.  

