```

This enables path MTU discovery for all neighbors in the "vpn_peers" group. The router will automatically:
1. Set initial TCP MTU to the egress interface's MTU
2. Enable the DF (Don't Fragment) bit in packets
3. Dynamically adjust MTU based on ICMP fragmentation-needed messages
4. Optimize TCP segment sizes without manual MTU configuration

VPN traffic traversing this BGP session will automatically use the largest unfragmented path MTU.
