To enable VPNv4 route exchange with the neighbor 192.168.5.8, configure the following in BGP group view:

```
enable-inter-as-vpn
```

This command allows VPN routes to propagate across autonomous system boundaries, which is required for sharing private network routes between sites. The default behavior disables inter-AS VPN exchange, so explicit configuration is necessary.
