- Set the BFD transmit interval (heartbeat messages) to **150ms**.
- Set the BFD receive interval (reply timeout) to **120ms**.
- Configure BFD to mark the link down after **8 consecutive missed checks**.

These changes apply only to the specified neighbor and won't disrupt existing BGP configurations.
