bgp
  group bgp_group1
   import route-policy STRIP_COMMUNITIES
  exit
exit
```

This policy removes all standard, extended, and large communities from incoming routes. If you need to target specific community values or other attributes (e.g., aggregator IDs), enhance the route-policy with matching conditions.
