To merge OSPF routes from process 45 into your BGP VPN instance with a metric of 500 and apply the POLICY_OSPF filtering rules, configure the following:

```cli
router bgp
 rib-management
  vpn-ipv4
   route-table-import POLICY_OSPF
  exit
