To ensure the BGP neighbor 192.168.5.5 does not inherit BFD settings from its group, configure the following commands:

```cli
configure terminal
router bgp
 group <group-name>
  neighbor 192.168.5.5
   no bfd-enable
   exit
  exit
 exit
```

Replace `<group-name>` with the actual BGP group name. This explicitly disables BFD for the specified neighbor while preserving the group's BFD settings for other neighbors.
