```cli
configure router bgp rib-management ipv4 route-table-import filter_vpn_routes
configure router bgp vpn-apply-import
```

These commands will:
1. Use the custom route policy `filter_vpn_routes` to control route imports into the IPv4 BGP RIB.
2. Ensure VPNv4 routes inherit the base instance BGP import policies, aligning with your route filtering strategy.
