To configure the Huawei NE40E for restart-friendly behavior with the specific peer at 192.168.50.20, use these CLI commands:

```cli
router bgp
 group <group-name>
  neighbor 192.168.50.20
   graceful-restart
    restart-time 120
    enable-notification
   exit
  exit
 exit
```

**Key Details:**  
- Replace `<group-name>` with the BGP group containing the peer.  
- `graceful-restart` enables BGP Graceful Restart for this neighbor.  
- `restart-time 120` signals the peer to wait 120 seconds during router reboots before tearing down the session.  
- `enable-notification` allows graceful session restart even if a NOTIFICATION message is sent.  

This configuration applies *only* to peer 192.168.50.20 without affecting other VPN instances or neighbors.
