To prevent your fully meshed BGP speakers from using the route reflector for updates, disable route reflection for the client group:

```bash
configure router bgp
 group <group-name>
  disable-client-reflect
```

Replace `<group-name>` with your BGP group containing the fully meshed clients. This stops the route reflector from reflecting routes to clients in that group, avoiding unnecessary hops.
