To configure your Huawei NE40E for up to 8 same-cost external BGP paths while ensuring only selected routes have next-hop adjustments, use these commands:

```
config>router>bgp
multipath 8 ebgp 8
```

**Explanation:**  
- `multipath 8 ebgp 8` enables load balancing for up to 8 EBGP paths of equal cost.  
- Only routes participating in load balancing will have their next-hop attributes modified.  
- Non-participating routes retain original next-hop details.  
- The `ebgp` parameter explicitly limits multipath selection to external peers only.  

This configuration selectively adjusts next-hops for load-balanced routes without affecting other route handling.
