## Proposed answer:
To assign a cluster identifier of `200` to your route reflector server and enhance resilience within your AS, use the following CLI commands. This configures the cluster ID in dot decimal notation (`0.0.0.200`) to prevent route propagation loops without disrupting existing VPN routes:

```cli
configure
router bgp
 cluster 0.0.0.200
exit
exit
