Replace `<CLIENT_GROUP_NAME>` with the BGP group name containing your fully meshed clients. This stops the hub from reflecting routes back to clients that already exchange routes directly, eliminating redundant propagation and potential loops. Clients will still advertise routes to the hub, but the hub won't bounce them between clients.
