To configure the BGP hold time for the neighbor 192.168.5.2 to 500 seconds:

```
configure terminal
router bgp
group <group-name>
neighbor 192.168.5.2
hold-time 500
exit
exit
```

Replace `<group-name>` with the BGP group containing the neighbor 192.168.5.2. This sets the maximum wait time for BGP messages from the neighbor to 500 seconds before declaring the session down.
