To throttle BGP updates to neighbor 192.168.5.5 with a minimum 20-second interval between duplicate route announcements, apply this configuration:

```
system-view
router bgp
 group <GROUP_NAME>
  neighbor 192.168.5.5
   min-route-advertisement 20
```

Replace `<GROUP_NAME>` with the BGP group containing the neighbor. This sets the minimum interval between identical route advertisements to 20 seconds.
