To ensure BGP sessions in group "bgp_grp1" recover smoothly after drops like maintenance, configure Graceful Restart helper functionality with these commands:

```cli
configure router bgp
    group "bgp_grp1"
        graceful-restart
            restart-time 300
            stale-routes-time 360
        exit
    exit
exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enables Graceful Restart helper mode for the group
2. Sets the neighbor restart wait time to 300 seconds (default)
3. Keeps stale routes for 360 seconds (exceeding the restart time)
