FuncDef:
The ext-community-change enable command enables a device to use route-policies to change the VPN-Target and SoO extended community attributes in matched BGP routes.
The undo ext-community-change enable command disables a device from using route-policies to change the VPN-Target or SoO extended community attribute in matched BGP routes.
By default, a BGP device cannot use route-policies to change the VPN-Target or SoO extended community attribute in matched BGP routes.
