To enable BGP to share larger aggregated network ranges under the VPN configuration 'vpnb', apply the following CLI commands:

```cli
configure router bgp
    best-path-selection
        as-path-ignore vpn-ipv4
    exit
    aggregator-id-zero
exit
```

