```json
{
    "FuncDef": "Displays detailed information about IPv6 BGP routes in the default-free zone (DFZ) that match a specified route distinguisher (RD), including route counts and attributes. This helps verify route advertisement and troubleshoot propagation issues.",
    "CLIs": [
