To restrict next-hop resolution for IPv6 routes only to those specified in your "customer_routes" filter, use the following CLI configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        shortcut-tunnel
            family ipv6
                resolution filter
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

This configures BGP to resolve next-hops **only** for IPv6 routes matching the tunnel types explicitly allowed under the `resolution-filter` context. Ensure your "customer_routes" filter is applied to the relevant tunnel policies to enforce the route restrictions.
