To configure the Huawei NE40E for EBGP multipath load balancing with up to 8 paths for identical metrics while only adjusting next-hop IPs for the involved routes, use the following commands:

```cli
configure router bgp
    multipath 8 ebgp 8 restrict exact-as-path
exit
```

This configuration:
- Enables multipath load balancing for EBGP routes.
- Allows up to 8 paths (`ebgp 8`) for prefixes with identical metrics.
- Ensures only routes with the exact AS path (`restrict exact-as-path`) are considered eligible for load balancing.
