To apply the OSPF_FILTER policy for outbound BGP advertisements of redistributed OSPF instance 65001 routes, configure the following:

```
configure
 router bgp <your_as_number>
  peer <neighbor_ip_address>
   export route-policy OSPF_FILTER
  exit
 exit
```

Replace `<your_as_number>` with your BGP autonomous system number and `<neighbor_ip_address>` with the specific neighbor's IP address. This attaches the policy directly to the neighbor for outbound route filtering.  

If applied to a BGP group instead:
```
configure
 router bgp <your_as_number>
  group <group_name>
   export route-policy OSPF_FILTER
  exit
 exit
```
