To view detailed configuration for the BGP peer group "test_group1", use:  
```  
display bgp group test_group1 verbose  
```  

For specific IPv6 multicast VPN details, also check the VPNv6 family status with:  
```  
display bgp vpnv6 group test_group1 verbose  
```  

