To configure BGP for recursive next-hop lookup only on customer-tagged routes:

```
router bgp <your_as_number>
 next-hop-resolution
  use-bgp-routes
  policy CUSTOMER_TAGGED_ONLY
 exit
```

Create the route policy to match your customer routes (replace `CUSTOMER_TAGGED_ONLY` with your policy name and define matching criteria like communities or prefixes in policy-options):

```
policy-statement CUSTOMER_TAGGED_ONLY
 <configure your route matching criteria here>
 exit
```

This enables BGP route recursion globally but restricts next-hop resolution to only routes permitted by your policy, effectively applying recursive lookup only to customer-tagged routes. Non-customer routes will follow default next-hop resolution behavior.
