To set the BGP local preference to 150 for specific VPN routes on the Huawei NE40E, configure the `local-preference` command at the appropriate BGP hierarchy (global, group, or neighbor level). Since you require this for site-to-site VPN routes, apply it directly to the relevant BGP neighbor under its group. Here are the commands:

```bash
config
 router bgp
  group <your-group-name>
   neighbor <neighbor-ip>
    local-preference 150
```

**Notes**:  
