To view which customer VPNs are configured to import routes tagged with the route target 10:20, use the following CLI command:

```huawei
display ip vpn-instance import-route-target 10:20
```

This command lists all VPN instances set to import routes with the specified route target (10:20). If no results appear, verify that VPN instances are explicitly configured to import this route target. For additional troubleshooting, check the BGP configuration for any `route-target-list` filters that might block the routes:

```huawei
display current-configuration | include route-target-list
```
