    AS_Path: 65001 65002  (Neighbor AS = 65001)  
  10.1.1.1 (metric) from 192.168.2.2  
    AS_Path: 65003 65004  (Neighbor AS = 65003)  
```  
Here, next-hop `10.1.1.1` is advertised by two neighbors in different ASes (`65001` vs. `65003`).
