- **`all`**: Shows routes from all enabled BGP address families (e.g., `ipv4`, `ipv6`, `vpn-ipv4`, `label-ipv4`).
- **`verbose`**: Displays comprehensive path attributes, including:
  - Route policies applied during import/export
  - AS paths
  - Next-hop information
  - Route distinguishers (for VPN families)
  - Community attributes
  - Route origin details

This command lists all paths processed by BGP, including policies affecting route distribution.
