To verify the BGP routes and path selections from neighbor 172.16.25.42 on your Huawei NE40E, use these commands:

1. **View all received routes from the neighbor (pre-policy):**  
   ```
   display bgp routing-table peer 172.16.25.42 received-routes
   ```

2. **View routes accepted into the BGP table (post-policy):**  
   ```
   display bgp routing-table peer 172.16.25.42
   ```

3. **Check detailed attributes of specific routes (e.g., AS_PATH, MED, LOCAL_PREF):**  
   ```
   display bgp routing-table <ip-prefix> <mask> verbose
   ```

4. **Verify applied policies affecting the neighbor:**  
   ```
   display current-configuration | include "peer 172.16.25.42"
   ```
