{'Parameters': 'all', 'Info': 'Displays all BGP VPNv4 routes.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'route-distinguisher route-distinguisher', 'Info': 'Displays the BGP routes with the specified RD.\nThe RD formats are divided into the following types:\n2-byte AS number:4-byte user-defined number, for example, 101:3. An AS number ranges from 0 to 65535. A user-defined number ranges from 0 to 4294967295. The AS number and the user-defined number cannot be 0s at the same time. That is, an RD cannot be 0:0.Integral 4-byte AS number:2-byte user-defined number, for example, 65537:3. An AS number ranges from 65536 to 4294967295. A user-defined number ranges from 0 to 65535. The AS number and user-defined number cannot be both 0s. That is, an RD cannot be 0:0.4-byte AS number in dotted notation:2-byte user-defined number, for example, 0.0:3 or 0.1:0.4-byte AS number in dotted notation is in the format of x.y, wherex and y are integers that range from 0 to 65535 and from 0 to 65535, respectively. A user-defined number ranges from 0 to 65535. The AS number and user-defined number cannot be both 0s. That is, an RD cannot be 0.0:0.IPv4-address:2-byte user-defined number, for example, 192.168.122.15:1. An IP address ranges from 0.0.0.0 to 255.255.255.255. A user-defined number ranges from 0 to 65535.'}
{'Parameters': 'as-path-filter as-path-filter-num', 'Info': 'Specifies the number of an AS_Path filter.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 1 to 256.'}
{'Parameters': 'as-path-filter-name', 'Info': 'Specifies the name of an AS_Path filter.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 51 case-sensitive characters, spaces not supported.'}
{'Parameters': 'regular-expression as-regular-expression', 'Info': 'Displays the routes that match the regular expression.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 80 characters.'}
{'Parameters': 'peer ipv4-address', 'Info': 'Displays the routes of the specified BGP peer.\nThe value is in dotted decimal notation.'}
{'Parameters': 'received-routes', 'Info': 'Displays the routes learned from a specified peer.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'advertised-routes', 'Info': 'Displays the routes advertised to a specified peer.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'time-range start-time', 'Info': 'Starting time ([0-10000]d[0-23]h[0-59]m[0-59]s).\nThe value is an integer ranging from 0 to 4294967295.'}
{'Parameters': 'time-range end-time', 'Info': 'Ending time ([0-10000]d[0-23]h[0-59]m[0-59]s).\nThe value is an integer ranging from 0 to 4294967295.'}
