---
## Proposed answer:
To configure the BGP MVPN group `mvpn_group1` to send updates every 20 seconds, use the following commands:

```cli
router bgp
 group mvpn_group1
  min-route-advertisement 20
```

This sets the minimum route advertisement interval to 20 seconds for all members of the `mvpn_group1` MVPN group. The existing VPN setups remain unaffected as the change is isolated to this group.
