## Proposed answer:
To verify the total count of VPWS service entries tracked by BGP in the L2VPN address family on a Huawei NE40E, use the following command:  

```  
display bgp l2vpn all routing-table | include "Route Type: VPWS" | count  
```  

This command:  
1. Displays all BGP L2VPN routing table entries (`display bgp l2vpn all routing-table`).  
2. Filters for lines containing the VPWS route type (`| include "Route Type: VPWS"`).  
3. Counts the number of matching VPWS entries (`| count`).  

The output will show:  
```  
Number of lines which match: <total_count>  
```  
Where `<total_count>` is the exact number of VPWS service entries.
