## Proposed answer:
To enable the feature that influences traffic path selection within neighbor group "BGP_Group_1" for more balanced traffic distribution, configure the MED attribute using the IGP cost. This ensures BGP advertisements reflect the IGP metric, promoting even traffic spreading across paths:

