To temporarily suspend BGP neighbor relationships for the neighbor group `prod_servers` without removing their configurations, use the `shutdown` command in the BGP group configuration context. This administratively disables the sessions while preserving all settings.

```cli
configure terminal
router bgp
group prod_servers
 shutdown
commit
