To enable passing extended communities for L2VPN to the BGP neighbor group `l2vpn_peers`, use the following configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp
    group "l2vpn_peers"
        outbound-route-filtering
            extended-community
        exit
    exit
exit
```

This configuration enables extended community support for outbound route filtering within the `l2vpn_peers` group, allowing the propagation of custom extended communities during L2VPN address distribution.
