- `extended-community` specifies extended community-based filtering.  
- `send-orf "customer_routes"` applies the "customer_routes" extended community policy to peers in this group, ensuring only routes matching your defined route targets are accepted.  

**Prerequisite:**  
Ensure the extended community policy "customer_routes" is already defined elsewhere in your configuration with the appropriate route targets for your customer networks.
