## User question:
Hey, on a Huawei NE40E box, I need to tweak the BGP multicast VPN setup—specifically, how do I make sure only certain routes get pushed to a bunch of neighbors grouped under "mvpn_peers" by checking their AS trail? I’ve got this AS-path-based blocker list called "as_blocker_55" ready, but where exactly do I hook it in to restrict what’s advertised?
