To enable BGP to automatically accumulate total internal IGP hops for the "core_peers" group, configure the AIGP feature under this group:

```
system-view
bgp <as-number>
 group core_peers
  aigp
```

Replace `<as-number>` with your BGP autonomous system number. This configuration allows BGP to consider end-to-end IGP metrics (internal hops) during path selection for routes exchanged with peers in the "core_peers" group.
