To add the description "Backbone_Provider_A" to the existing BGP neighbor group "ISP_A", use the following commands:

```cli
router bgp <Your_AS_Number>
 group ISP_A
  description Backbone_Provider_A
```

Replace `<Your_AS_Number>` with your actual BGP autonomous system number. This will label the group with the readable tag directly in the configuration.
