To configure the "mvpn_clients" group to synchronize multicast routing updates through a central route reflector, use the following commands:

```
configure router bgp
 group "mvpn_clients"
  cluster 192.0.2.1
 exit
exit
```

Replace `192.0.2.1` with your central reflector's cluster ID (typically the router ID of the main reflector node). This marks all peers in the "mvpn_clients" group as route reflector clients and configures them to synchronize multicast routes exclusively through the specified cluster.
------------
