## User question:
Hey, I've got a Huawei NE40E where I need to handle multicast routing updates via BGP—there's a cluster of peers called "mvpn_clients" that should all sync their info through a central point instead of directly. How do I adjust the BGP multicast VPN settings to mark this group as dependent on the main reflector node?
