## User question:
Hey, on a Huawei NE40E, how do I set up BGP to cap L2VPN address-discovery routes at 50k from peers in the "l2vpn-peers" group, get a heads-up when they hit 80% full, and if it goes over, make the box kill the neighbor connection for 60 minutes automatically?
