To adjust the timer for retrying failed BGP connections to 45 seconds for the neighbor group "bgp_grp01", use these CLI commands:

```
system-view
bgp <as-number>
group bgp_grp01
connect-retry 45
commit
```

Replace `<as-number>` with your router's actual BGP AS number. This sets the connection retry interval to 45 seconds for all neighbors in the group.
