## User question:
Hey, got a Huawei NE40E setup where I’m using a BGP VPNv4 neighbor group called "VPN_GROUP" to exchange routes with a partner. Their side keeps rejecting our updates because our path history shows internal-only AS tags. How do I scrub those internal AS markers from the advertised route paths without messing up our own group’s AS identifier?
