To prevent VPNv4 BGP routes from being reflected back to the originating peers in your "customer_group" on the Huawei NE40E, use the following configuration:

```cli
system-view
bgp <your_as_number>
 group customer_group
  disable-client-reflect
```

This command disables route reflection from the route reflector to clients within "customer_group", eliminating the risk of route boomeranging while maintaining other reflection behaviors.
