To apply the "internet_routes" filter to outbound IPv6 updates for the BGP peer group "global_peers", use the following CLI commands:

```
bgp <your_AS_number>
 group global_peers
  ipv6-family unicast
   peer global_peers route-policy internet_routes export
```

Replace `<your_AS_number>` with your BGP autonomous system number. This configures the export policy "internet_routes" for IPv6 unicast route advertisements to all peers in the "global_peers" group.
