Based on your requirements, the CLI configuration for Huawei NE40E routers would be:

```cli
config>router>bgp
    group EXTERNAL
        remove-private skip-peer-as
    exit
    neighbor <CORE_GROUP_IP_1>
        group CORE_GROUP
        peer-as <CORE_AS_1>
