To adjust the BGP refresh timer for VPNv4 routes to 45 seconds for all peers in the "prod_group" cluster, use the following configuration:

```
configure terminal
router bgp
 group prod_group
  min-route-advertisement 45
  exit
 exit
```

This sets the minimum route advertisement interval to 45 seconds for the specified BGP group.
