To ensure the router does not alter next-hop details when sharing routes with BGP peers in the `interas_group` for the L2VPN address family, configure the `next-hop-unchanged` command for the group. Here are the required CLI commands:

```
configure router
 bgp
  group "interas_group"
   next-hop-unchanged
  exit
 exit
exit
```

This configuration preserves the original next-hop information when advertising routes to peers in the specified group, maintaining gateway details across inter-domain links.
