To prevent routes learned from VPNv6 neighbors in the group `vpn6_peers` from looping back to them, apply the following configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp group vpn6_peers
 loop-detect discard-route
exit
```

This command discards any routes received from peers that contain your own AS number in the AS path, ensuring they aren't readvertised back to the same peers.
------------
As a network device expert, please determine whether the following answer correctly responds to the user's question based on the router configuration manual. Only output "Correct" or "Incorrect" without any explanation or additional information. You must make your own judgment based on the Router configuration manual provided to you, not on your own knowledge.
---
## User question:
Hey, I’m setting up a bunch of VPNv6 neighbors in a group called vpn6_peers on my Huawei NE40E. How do I make sure that any routes I learn from these buddies don’t get looped back to them accidentally? New to this box and don’t want to mess up the routing.
---
## Proposed answer:
To prevent routes learned from VPNv6 neighbors in the group `vpn6_peers` from looping back to them, apply the following configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp group vpn6_peers
 loop-detect discard-route
exit
```

This command discards any routes received from peers that contain your own AS number in the AS path, ensuring they aren't readvertised back to the same peers.
---
## Router configuration manual:
CLIs:
peer <group-name> update-group-independent
undo peer <group-name> update-group-independent
FuncDef:
The peer update-group-independent command sets a specified peer or each peer in a peer group as an independent update peer-group.
The undo peer update-group-independent command removes the setting of a specified peer or each peer in a peer group as an independent update peer-group.
By default, no peer is set as an independent update peer-group.
ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'group-name', 'Info': 'Specifies the name of a peer group.\nThe name is a string of 1 to 47 case-sensitive characters, with spaces not supported. When double quotation marks are used around the string, spaces are allowed in the string.'}
---
Please answer Correct or Incorrect.
