To apply the existing filter "bgp_filter123" for outbound route advertisements to the "l2vpn_peers" BGP neighbor group while preserving your L2VPN setup, use the following commands:

```cli
configure router bgp
    group "l2vpn_peers"
        vpn-apply-export
        export route-policy "bgp_filter123"
    exit
exit
```

**Explanation:**  
- `vpn-apply-export` ensures the base instance export policy applies to L2VPN routes.  
- `export route-policy "bgp_filter123"` directly attaches your filter to outbound advertisements for the neighbor group.  

This configuration uses the existing filter without modifying L2VPN-specific settings.
