To ensure your BGP neighbor group "bgp_peers" exchanges VPN route-target routes properly, configure the following commands:

```cli
group bgp_peers
  graceful-restart
    long-lived
      family route-target
  outbound-route-filtering
```

These commands:
1. Activate the `route-target` address family for VPN filtering under long-lived graceful restart
2. Enable outbound route filtering capabilities for the neighbor group

The configuration ensures peers exchange and process VPN routing information using the route-target family.
