Here are the configuration commands for your Huawei NE40E to act as a central route reflector for VPNv4 routes in group "vpn-clients" within AS 65001:

```
router bgp 65001
 optimal-route-reflection
  location 1 primary-ip-address <PRIMARY_IP>
 exit
 group vpn-clients
