 exit
ipv4-family vpnv4
 peer vpn-clients enable
```

**Replace `<PRIMARY_IP>`** with the primary IP address representing location 1. This configuration enables optimal route reflection for VPNv4 routes, ensuring clients receive only the best paths calculated from their perspective while preventing unnecessary route flooding.
