To configure your Huawei NE40E to include extended community tags (like jumbo-sized communities) for the "VPN_CUSTOMERS" group in VPNv4:

```cli
configure router
    bgp
        group "VPN_CUSTOMERS"
            link-bandwidth
                send-to-ebgp vpnv4
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

**Key points:**
- This enables the `link-bandwidth` extended community handling specifically for your VPN_CUSTOMERS BGP group.
- The `send-to-ebgp vpnv4` command forces inclusion of extended communities when advertising VPNv4 routes to these EBGP peers.
- Apply this configuration directly to the BGP group to affect all customers in "VPN_CUSTOMERS" simultaneously.

Ensure VPNv4 address-family is properly configured for these peers beforehand.
