**Explanation:**  
This configuration removes private AS numbers (64512-65535) from the AS_PATH when advertising routes to the `ISP_Backbone` peer group. The `limited` parameter ensures removal stops at the first public ASN encountered, preserving the critical path information while scrubbing internal-only ASNs.
