To ensure the Huawei NE40E includes oversized custom tags (extended and large communities) when sharing routes with the BGP group "mcast-group1" for multicast VPNv4, use the following CLI configuration:

```cli
configure terminal
router bgp
 group mcast-group1
  no disable-communities extended large
