To block unwanted paths from your "global_peers" BGP neighbors using the "internet_routes" rule-set, apply the following CLI configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp
    group "global_peers"
        outbound-route-filtering
            extended-community
                accept-orf
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

