This configuration enables BGP Outbound Route Filtering (ORF) for the "global_peers" group. By activating `extended-community` and `accept-orf`, the router will accept and apply the ORF-based filter rules defined in your "internet_routes" rule-set to incoming route advertisements from these neighbors. Ensure "internet_routes" is preconfigured as a valid prefix-list or route-policy.
