To propagate BGP route validation outcomes (source AS legitimacy) to the "international-peers" group automatically, configure the following:

```cli
# Enter BGP configuration mode
configure
router bgp
 group international-peers
  extended-community
 exit
```

This configuration enables extended community support for outbound route filtering to the specified BGP group. The validation results (e.g., valid/invalid source AS) will be automatically signaled to peers using extended communities without manual per-prefix handling.
