To set up BGP for your private network "customer123" to exchange routes using MPLS-like tags for regular IPv4 traffic, configure the VPNv4 address family and adjust the BGP settings as follows:

```
configure router
    bgp
        group <group-name>
            family vpnv4
            next-hop-self
            neighbor <neighbor-ip>
                remote-as <as-number>
                family vpnv4
                exit
            exit
        exit
```

