Based on your requirement to delay BGP path selection changes by approximately 90 seconds after policy modifications, configure the following:  

```  
router bgp  
 graceful-restart  
  stale-routes-time 90  
  exit  
exit  
```  

**Explanation:**  
This configures BGP to retain stale routes for **90 seconds** (1.5 minutes) after policy changes or session restarts. During this period, existing routes remain active while neighbors stabilize and converge, delaying the switch to new path selection logic until the timer expires.
