## Proposed answer:
To ensure the router verifies tunnel status before advertising labeled routes to neighbor 192.168.5.5, configure BGP next-hop resolution to strictly use only tagged LSPs. This forces the router to consider only operational tunnels with an admin tag for next-hop resolution.

```
configure router bgp
  next-hop-resolution
    labeled-routes
      transport-tunnel
        family ipv4
          enforce-strict-tunnel-tagging
        exit
      exit
    exit
  exit
```

