- `extended-community` under this context allows applying extended community-based filters (leverage your existing "BLOCK_LEAKS" deny list here via route-policy).  

**Next Steps:**  
1. Ensure a route-policy references "BLOCK_LEAKS" to block unwanted prefixes.  
2. Attach this policy to the neighbor in the VPNv6 family (e.g., `peer <EUROPE_WEST_IP> route-policy BLOCK_LEAKS import` under `ipv6-family vpnv6`).  

Replace `<EUROPE_WEST_IP>` with the actual neighbor IP. This configures the neighbor to accept your locally defined filters.
