Based on your request, here are the CLI commands to configure your Huawei NE40E:

```cli
configure router bgp
    vpn-apply-import
    exit
configure router bgp rib-management ipv4
    route-table-import POLICY_OSPF
    exit
```

**Key actions performed:**
1. Enabled `vpn-apply-import` to apply base BGP import policies to VPNv4 routes
2. Configured `route-table-import` to inject OSPF instance 25 routes into BGP-VPN IPv4 using your existing "POLICY_OSPF" rules
3. The static metric (MED) of 50 must be configured within your existing "POLICY_OSPF" route policy using:
   ```cli
   route-policy POLICY_OSPF permit node <X>
      apply cost 50
   ```

**Verification commands:**
```cli
display bgp vpnv4 all routing-table
display route-policy name POLICY_OSPF
```
