To import active customer routes, including MPLS-tagged routes, from the `customer_vpn` private routing domain into the main IPv6 BGP table using the filter `filter123`, configure the following commands:

```cli
configure router
    bgp
        vpn-apply-import
        import filter123
    exit
exit
```

This configuration:
- Enables `vpn-apply-import` to apply the base BGP import policies to VPN routes (including `customer_vpn`).
- Uses `import filter123` to enforce your existing route filter during the import process, ensuring only desired routes are pulled into the IPv6 BGP table.
