## Proposed answer:
To address the issue of a lagging neighbor in a BGP group causing delays, configure the link-bandwidth extended community to optimize route distribution. Use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
group <group_name>
 link-bandwidth
  send-to-ebgp ipv4
