CLIs:
peer <group-name> advertise add-path path-number <path-number>
undo peer <group-name> advertise add-path
FuncDef:
The peer advertise add-path command configures the maximum number of routes that the device can send to a specified IBGP peer.
The undo peer advertise add-path command restores the default configurations.
By default, the device sends only the optimal route to the specified IBGP peer.
