To adjust the timer for waiting on peers in the `bgp_grp1` group to send their final route update signal, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```cli
router bgp
 group bgp_grp1
  graceful-restart
   stale-routes-time 500
   exit
  exit
 exit
```

This sets the maximum wait time for stale routes from peers in `bgp_grp1` to 500 seconds after a graceful restart is initiated.
