{'Parameters': 'route-filter route-filter-name', 'Info': 'Specifies the name of a route filter to be used to create ingress LSPs based on BGP labeled routes.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 200 case-sensitive characters, spaces not supported. If parameters are included in the referenced route-filter, specify values for them in the format of (var1, var2, ...var8) behind the route-filter name. A maximum of eight parameters can be specified, and each value ranges from 1 to 200 characters.'}
