To configure the router to wait no longer than 180 seconds for neighbor `192.168.5.8` to recover after a restart, use the following commands:

```
bgp <your_as_number>
 peer 192.168.5.8
  graceful-restart
   restart-time 180
   quit
  quit
 quit
```

Replace `<your_as_number>` with your BGP autonomous system number. This sets the graceful restart recovery timer specifically for `192.168.5.8` to 180 seconds.
