To adjust the maximum wait time for the "all routes sent" confirmation to 500 seconds for the BGP peer group "bgp_peers", use the following commands:

```cli
router bgp
 group bgp_peers
  graceful-restart
   stale-routes-time 500
   exit
  exit
 exit
```

This configuration sets the `stale-routes-time` to 500 seconds under the `graceful-restart` context for the specified peer group, ensuring the router waits up to 500 seconds for the final End-of-RIB marker after a session reset.
