To address the BGP session rush with peer 192.168.1.5, configure the hold timer to 500 seconds and set the minimum acceptable hold time to 500 seconds. This ensures the router waits for up to 500 seconds before declaring the peer unreachable during route synchronization.

```cli
configure terminal
router bgp
 peer 192.168.1.5
  hold-time 500 min 500
```
