To apply the "bgp_filter2" path-based filter for outbound BGP updates to your MDT peer cluster, use the following CLI configuration commands. Replace `<MDT_Group_Name>` with your specific BGP group name for the MDT peer cluster:

```cli
group <MDT_Group_Name>
