To configure the router to wait no more than 500 seconds for confirmation from the BGP peer at 192.168.5.8, use the following commands:

```
peer 192.168.5.8
 hold-time 500
```

This sets the hold time to 500 seconds for the specified peer. The session will terminate if no keepalive or update message is received within this period.
