## User question:
I’m struggling with a Huawei NE40E setup where multicast-related route advertisements to my peer device at 192.168.5.2 need to be spaced out more—like at least 20 seconds apart. How do I adjust the BGP neighbor settings for this timing constraint while keeping things stable?
