To prevent MDT-related BGP routes from being advertised to your BGP group "VPN_GROUP" using filter list 2100, apply the following configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp
group "VPN_GROUP"
vpn-apply-export
export 2100
exit
exit
```

**Explanation:**  
- `vpn-apply-export` ensures the export policy applies to MDT-SAFI routes.  
