To restrict incoming multicast VPN path information from the BGP peer at 192.168.50.20 using the `CUSTOM_FILTER` route policy, configure the following commands:

```cli
configure router bgp
    neighbor 192.168.50.20
        import CUSTOM_FILTER
        vpn-apply-import
    exit
exit
