To set up BMP monitoring for all BGP peers in the `customer_vpn123` VRF on the Huawei NE40E, use the following CLI commands:

```bash
config
   bmp
      station CUSTOMER_BMP
         connection
            router customer_vpn123
         exit
      exit
   exit
!
service
   vprn customer_vpn123
      bgp
         group CUSTOMER_GROUP
            monitor
               station CUSTOMER_BMP
            exit
         exit
      exit
   exit
```

### Key points:
