2. **BGP group** `CUSTOMER_GROUP` under the VPRN service uses the station for monitoring.
3. All BGP peers in `CUSTOMER_GROUP` will send monitoring data to the BMP collector via the specified VRF.

> **Note**: Replace `CUSTOMER_GROUP` with the actual BGP group name containing your peers. Ensure the BMP collector is reachable within `customer_vpn123`.
